\"text-align:right\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftrashslot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TrashSlot</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">&gt;= v0.8.4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftravelersbackpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traveler's Backpack</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">&gt;= v1.3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftrinkets\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Trinkets</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">&gt;= v1.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fwaystones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waystones</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">&gt;= v0.9.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fxaeros-minimap-fair\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's Minimap (Fair-Play)</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">&gt;= v0.9</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fzenith\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Zenith</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">&gt;= v0.9.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zenith-attributes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Zenith Attributes</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">&gt;= v1.8</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3>推薦項目</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/raised\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Raised</a> Mod</strong>：將快捷欄向上移動，避免紋理被裁切；</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/nbtpack-grass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Grass Block Plugin for NBTpack</a> 資源包</strong>：調整物品顯示角度，讓擁有長紋理的物品（例如劍）在圓角物品欄中看起來不會顯得突兀。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Minecraft 資源包版本相容性</h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fPack_format\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 資源包格式</a></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Minecraft 資源包</th>\n<th>Cobblemon 介面</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>&lt;= v0.7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>15</td>\n<td>&gt;= v0.8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>34</td>\n<td>&gt;= v1.4</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>內含內容</h3>\n<p>本專案包含修改版的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fpoketips\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">cobblemon tooltips</a> 資源包。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fpoketips\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://api.mcbanners.com/banner/saved/LZrReFoiohJHWs.png\" alt=\"Banner\"></a></p>\n<h2>其他：</h2>\n<p>紋理設計參考自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/torrezx-improved-library\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Torrezx-Improved Library</a> 資源包的書籍，並靈感源自 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fSbIA8FKhwl0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Legends of Arceus trailer</a> 預告片中的書籍。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252fchannels%252f934267676354834442%252f1091579923396820992\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.1.0/assets/compact/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> 歡迎前往 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon 官方 Discord 伺服器</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fcobblemon-interface-modded\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fM4M5K4BDR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p>",
